{"author":{"id":"585844baa6074d44d241f46aa7c9f21ff46653adf617d7f070fbfe327626c989"},"ops":[{"type":2,"timestamp":1794930837,"nonce":"9xeqs5rrErbTZa67HoffT3kyVLY=","title":"Exclude host linker metadata from cross-target packages","was":"While validating c878f2a's hxn-av AAC decoder on unthreaded Emscripten, hxn package generated a wasm link.xml containing macOS AudioToolbox/VideoToolbox frameworks. xavi-backend is both a build dependency and a target dependency: Cargo reports build-script-executed messages for the host and wasm copies. Linked::read currently merges all of them. The wasm native-static-libs file is empty and correctly contains no Apple frameworks, but host build-dependency messages contaminate its linker XML."}]}